      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n*****VIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE****\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip are delighted to offer to the market an outstanding luxury detached home in one of Galway's most exclusive and sought after locations. No 45 Hazelwood, set just off the Taylor's Hill road, is one of the most impressive detached family residences to come to the Galway market this year. Built in 1996, this impressive property approximately 204sqm of well-proportioned, bright and spacious, living accommodation, which is finished to the highest standards. Set on a large corner site in a quiet quiet cul-de-sac, this luxurious family home is being sold to include many features including extensive tiling, hardwood floors, a fully integrated kitchen, conservatory, converted attic and externally, a large corner site with side access and private rear garden. \n\nWonderfully presented, this owner-occupied property is close to all amenities and is within a short stroll of Galway city centre. Hazelwood is a mature and quiet residential estate of detached homes with generous open green space. There are multiple schools, both primary and secondary, all within a 10-minute walk, as are numerous recreational facilities. For those seeking a detached home in a hugely desirable location with all conveniences close to hand, the search may be over. Viewing is essential and is strictly by appointment only. \n\nFeatures:\nWonderfully presented family home\nComprising approximately 2,200t² \nHighly efficient C rated home. \nNew Boiler\nPVC double glazed windows\nOil fired central heating\nCoverted attic \nLandscaped low-maintenance rear garden \nLarge side gate access\nCobblelock paved parking area\nExcellent local amenities\nClose distance to Salthill and Galway City \nOn a regular bus route\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that: (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) Any intending purchasers or tenants must not rely the descriptions, dimensions, references to condition or necessary permissions for use and occupation as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of DNG Maxwell Heaslip & Leonard has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. DNG Maxwell Heaslip &Leonard accept no liability (including liability to any prospective purchaser or lessee by reason of negligence or negligent misstatement) for loss or damage caused by any statements, opinions, information or other matters (expressed or implied) arising out of, contained in or derived from, or for any omissions from this brochure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.2 x 1.5\nWith tiled/wood flooring and radiator.\n\nLiving Room - 4.5 x 4\nFront facing living room with wood floors, open fire place and four front facing windows.\n\nPlayroom / Office - 2.5 x 3.2\nFront facing with wood floor.\n\nKitchen - 4 x 4\nWith new parquet flooring, feature island, built in kitchen units and access to rear conservatory and dining room.\n\nConservatory - 3.9 x 3.7\nWith new parquet flooring and wrape around windows overlooking the private back garden.\n\nDining Room - 4.7 x 3.2\nWith semi solid wood floor, window and fireplace.\n\nUtility Room - 1.6 x 2.2\nWith wood floor, back door, built in units and plumbed.\n\nW.C - 1.3 x 1.3\nWith tiled floor, whb, wc and window.\n\nUpstairs: Landing - 5.4 x 2.6\nWith carpet floor.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.4 x 4\nFront facing with wood floor, two windows and built in wardrobe.\n\nEn suite - \nWith tiled floor, whb, wc, shower and window.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.4 x 2.5\nFront facing with wood floor and built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom Three - 3.9 x 2.9\nRear facing with semi solid wood floor, built in wardrobe and radiator.\n\nEn Suite - \nWith whb, wc, shower and window.\n\nBedroom Four - 2.8 x 3.3\nRear facing double room with carpet floor and closet.\n\nBathroom - 2.2 x 1.9\nWith laminate flooring, whb, wc, bath/shower and rear window.\n\nAttic - 3.7 x 4.2\nWith wood flooring, velux window and storage.\n\n"
